<h2>5. The website</h2>
<p>
  The site uses no cookies, analytics or advertising trackers, and fonts are served from our own domain. When you sign in,
  your session tokens are kept only in that tab's session storage and are removed when you close the tab; your chosen
  language is remembered in the same place. The Sign in with Apple and Cloudflare Turnstile scripts load only on the
  sign-in page. Turnstile processes browser signals to check that sign-in link requests come from a person.
</p>

